all the way over there for all I know.

240
00:31:54,302 --> 00:31:57,159
So you didn't notice
anything different about yourself?

241
00:31:57,801 --> 00:31:59,522
- No.
- I mean, nothing even...

242
00:31:59,601 --> 00:32:02,655
